    <guid isPermaLink="false">668161d1cdd230b23b3fa8a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 13:46:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当得知我计划去印度的时候，</span></p><span></span><p><span>周围朋友都是劝退的口吻，</span></p><span></span><p><span>列举了从断章取义的新闻中爆出来的种种危险，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是我有个优点就是不听劝，哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>直到去了印度才知道，我们对这里是有一些认知偏差的，</span></p><span></span><p><span>破除刻板印象或者固有认知的方法就是自己亲自的去体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这趟印度之行非常精彩，也遭遇了不听劝的“报应”</span></p><span></span><p><span>具体故事听听本期节目吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>印度拍了很多照片放在这里给大家感受下</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FunfwDZcMuXU6EDBRTYBOBTIcb2z.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>泰姬陵外的小朋友</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsR-4WEZ1FjDU2blv4gnt9L1N0P1.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>新德里机场佛手装饰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FipRBOOhy4J1A5-rjXnNgMdpLp-h.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>德里肯德基遇到的小女孩</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fob5qQlw6oSudFt0ZEFMdAvWHfDE.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>新德里到阿格拉的火车里</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQ5M4VpLKVmvJEU5PV8tq-J6xcj.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>像阿凡提的出租车师傅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgusWMCUQ35x_aW-gzIAjyhvr4wC.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>红堡遥望泰姬陵</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh8S4jLHGbvRumFHRNgcAIm0iWFw.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>路边偶遇的婚礼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs6xi_u7a5ggU503RsdSA2pf2YSS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>城市宫殿外遇到的美好</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoCZAYMhDemYB_CRubmgwZN7mtz8.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwKvsjSRvS_kCwcO6SkY7PPEpxB.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpWSOEDyH4CTs3PFe5QyHw1Qu7le.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsiIAEgaH8RkzpcdhsefLcOVshom.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhzdeQpbTEcbxA_Z9RbT5iG5DD7-.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuqbujTjeAj72Wcr_CnQQsiYGgXr.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>星动推荐音乐：《神奇》by孙燕姿，《爱与诚》by古巨基</span></p><span></span><p><span>星动频道收听平台：小宇宙/喜马拉雅/蜻蜓FM/网易云音乐/荔枝播客/Spotify/ Apple Podcast/QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
