    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>松弛感是最近提得很多的理想生活状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>将时间拉回到小时候那个时候的天真烂漫状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>到现在的生活状态身上加载了多少不必要的念头</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目大家请跟随我一起通过尼泊尔之行</span></p><span></span><p><span>探索怎么获得松弛感的心法</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a></span></strong><span> 尼泊尔带回来让人回归宁静的音乐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a></span></strong><span> 尼泊尔旅行经典线路介绍</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a></span></strong><span> 奇他旺丛林探险</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a></span></strong><span> 博卡拉的等风来</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a></span></strong><span> 大佛塔的开示</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a></span></strong><span> 跟尼泊尔人学习如何获得松弛感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a></span></strong><span> 日常获得松弛感的小方法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiaKpzXzNcfpNTeOePAzHDzM7pT8.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>博达哈大佛寺</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llma50JPfzEWkd5Mdw7D4PwhyjAh.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>奇他旺丛林探险</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgdke8JFs7nLBZaS4NEAKczCYjXG.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>印度犀牛</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FunVDIeZvHyYySCsvlbQRkxYSJwn.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>奇他旺清晨丛林泛舟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjfkDqJVoblRzZXEPMqXgA-ghfnL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>纳加阔特山脊酒店风景</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_ZhmSZFx8JETx6N9I-Rbkc_Fp6.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>杜巴广场画唐卡的手工艺人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqp5OwbVPS_z6TJoseKaHBb_sXsV.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>加德满都杜巴广场</span></p><span></span><p><span>星动推荐音乐：《Jap Man Sat Nam》by Snatam Kaur ，《故乡》by塔斯肯</span></p><span></span><p><span>星动频道收听平台：小宇宙/喜马拉雅/蜻蜓FM/网易云音乐/荔枝播客/Spotify/ Apple Podcast/QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
