    <guid isPermaLink="false">66042d931519139e4ffab9e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目想跟大家分享关于长白山的那些星动感受，这几年基本每年冬天都会去到长白山。因为这边不仅可以滑雪，还可以泡温泉、吃人参鸡汤。非常推荐既想体验冰雪运动又想有一些景点，特别是又想泡温泉的朋友到长白山。节目中将跟大家分享2天、3天、5天的各种玩法。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjvNFZuwyIlfFBCkNkIDjHgHGwR-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>长白山天池</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lh8tAE85y1Lk3T-cCdxDE3kpS8OK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>长白山北坡，这边有温泉鸡蛋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmx_hpkSgXpevO4M65NPqYC3ACiX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>长白山景区里的地下森林</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnB-J8LBRgcNw3-HndEjcxksENl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqrETqwHsuzGcp7nIuf4YqfgFsIu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>雾凇漂流</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvuPw5EELKmOvgE2vfdMqcaHku3Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>万达雪场的新年烟火</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgVLwjejFLGo0FgSqTRhYqM_8FuE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>李狗蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>星动推荐音乐：《我好想你》by苏打绿</span></p><span></span><p><span>星动频道收听平台：小宇宙/喜马拉雅/蜻蜓FM/网易云音乐/荔枝播客/Spotify/ Apple Podcast</span></p>]]></description>
