  <item>
    <title>EP06. 星动2023 |海与烟火还有周杰伦，心动瞬间与自我探索的惊喜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658da9996396a4645a47803d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658da9996396a4645a47803d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Dec 2023 17:00:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2023好像按了加速键，转眼间已近年底。在这一年的地球旅行中，有哪些让你怦然心动的经历可以被Mark。我也借着做这期节目的时间，为今年选出了最星动的经历，精彩内容尽在本期中。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi44GvFGkRihawsZpQ8tJN0tDtdP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgkY9EGWlZzZbtvjYyYYdf-Uzigx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWEp8YAgOmDanGO9nkt5TQOog3g.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrT2BVfgyRZJfypirWQsvgIugwXs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDhOKCvu3pOv_fdiVYjJYOK9Ml_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVB4EhVq2LgDsx8XD9oMmHUoAYH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>星动推荐音乐：《我的地盘》by周杰伦，《未知的精彩》by孙燕姿</span></p><span></span><p><span>星动频道收听平台：小宇宙/喜马拉雅/蜻蜓FM/网易云音乐/荔枝播客/Spotify/ Apple Podcast</span></p>]]></description>
