    <guid isPermaLink="false">65787691991e2ee608bb2776</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Dec 2023 15:04:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提到重庆有很多网红的形容词，山城、8D魔幻城市、赛博朋克等等。而最让我魂牵梦绕的是在山水间万家灯火映衬下的人间烟火。所以本期节目将带大家去了解一个更接地气的重庆，以及这座城市美丽的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下浩里</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzE3MTctYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy8zRS84OC9HTUNvT1NJSlQyUGdBQy16VWdLTFQxcFUuanBnIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>石榴树下的坝坝茶</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzdhMDItYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy8xNy9BQS9HS3dSSWFzSlQyUTBBREFmLWdLTFQ0UHYuanBnIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2Q3OTMtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy8wNS81Ni9HTUNvT1I0SlQyUkZBRHRVU3dLTFQ0dzYuanBnIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>推荐关于了解重庆人的两本书：</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzlhODktYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy82Qi84Ny9HS3dSSVVFSlRqY0JBQW1OeVFLS3JXWHQucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>《饥饿的女儿》</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2Q0ZGYtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy9BNy80MC9HTUNvT1NRSlRqZEZBQXF1UHdLS3JiTzcucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op